{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S10–S12 等短停留段落的纵向信息切换较密，扫读不如 X 的左右分栏直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】把每段最重要的心理转折突出出来，观众不必读完所有文字就能抓住人物当下的处境；同时，感受随音乐具体段落出现，使情绪变化不只是抽象标签，而有了连续的音乐依据。它也更清楚地呈现了从不甘、怀念、孤独、动摇到接纳想念并继续生活的心理过程，尤其把舍不得亲近与不愿重新忍受委屈之间的矛盾讲得更细。X 的左右分栏确实更方便快速扫读，但右侧感受词多为并列罗列，音乐细节之间的先后、转折和情绪层次不如 Y 清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a70704c9-a5b8-4a58-a08e-16b7082d57c4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005155123823Z", "elapsed_seconds": 97.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:53:32.701906+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "243f25e43c04670edef7fd83ee50068607c27beb84c8ceaa6e121b700517aa8d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha